  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0c553b06-1ab7-466b-aa32-64602d4ab3e4.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/XXjnbBh8pM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1040918/description_e13028a0-c225-4906-873c-0fe77fa43c6b.png\"></a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=59481421\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1040918/description_1fe6d376-3e7f-424d-9e08-253ef6ca66cb.png\"></a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@thatdudepeter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1040918/description_c6635aca-796f-4eb9-8b64-f1a12be153fc.png\"></a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fthatdudepeter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1040918/description_7d77ee8e-8ae2-49b1-875e-bb02d2d25683.png\"></a><br><br></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\"><em><strong>&lt;已停產&gt;</strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">在 Minecraft 中完整重現&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.ea.com%252fgames%252fapex-legends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">APEX LEGENDS</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">這基本上定義了整個整合包，這就是一個作為模組整合包的 Apex Legends 完全重製版，</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">包含所有的移動機制</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">槍械</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">傳奇角色</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">特殊裝備</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">等等...</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9261d594-6d1a-4539-97fd-c56eec9f2342.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">這個模組整合包附帶了一張地圖，其中包含兩個子地圖：一個是大逃殺模式，另一個是競技場模式。是的，競技場模式回歸了。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">競技場地圖是原始的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapexlegends.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fEncore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Encore</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">而大逃殺地圖是<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.ea.com%252fgames%252fapex-legends%252fmaps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">所有地圖的合併版本</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">所有地圖均由我製作，因此保留所有權利。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果有人希望將它們單獨發布，請務必在評論區提出建議！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_63fa53b4-fcbc-42e5-8c9e-b02931caf773.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
